Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人不能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会告诉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完事后再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天必须动手  要安静利落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do it today. It has to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说我们要跟她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tell her we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远离其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ain't us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:49.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  的确不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.21,0:00:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能息事宁人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we avoid a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避免死伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要一个人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我和你一起去  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go with you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是搜刮搜刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking for a little vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吸过最好的毒品就藏在床垫里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best dope I ever had was in a mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个监狱一定很无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place must have been no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己以前为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know why you do the things you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯下累累恶行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choices you make?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们把米琼恩交给总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we give the Governor Michonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就放弃进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woodbury stands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想  可这是不得已为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it, but it's what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得偷偷地干  所以要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to make it quiet. We need your help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没告诉其他人对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't told any of the others, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有赫谢尔  达里尔  还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Hershel, Daryl and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是核心人物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我和总督行动时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we'd go out on runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀人都是砸碎脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd bash somebody's skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,割开喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}slash somebody's throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总说  "永远别浪费子弹"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd say, "Never waste a bullet."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道那只是他嗜杀的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought it was just an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那个姑娘交给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't gonna kill her, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只会折磨她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna do things to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能挖出她的一只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably take out one of her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者两只都挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of 'em, most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就为了渺茫的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd let that happen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让这种事发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是冷酷无情  友好警官  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cold as ice, Officer Friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得用金属线绑她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能用普通绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用金属线  她咬不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wire. Nothing she could chew through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道自己为何做出恶行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I do the things I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己都不了解自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a damn mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我了解你  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我很了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有做这事的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't got the spine for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在中午前把她送给总督 \N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get her to the Governor by noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快来  -快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Come on! - Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:05:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快来  -这里  这里 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Here! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们下次再想闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They try to drive up to the gate again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆胎也许能阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe some blown tires will stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好主意  -是米琼恩的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a good idea. - It was Michonne's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没必要打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要让他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to make their getting at us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击我们是得不偿失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}more trouble than it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有威士忌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got any whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧  伏特加也凑合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'd even drink vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧  莫尔 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell, Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我们一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about occupying the same space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你跟我们一伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟弟弟共进退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我们共进退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's here for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不该喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not time to do shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧选边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to pick a damn side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和在营地时不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't like you was back in the camp--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时你怯怯懦懦\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little mouse running around,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杯弓蛇影\N{\fnArial\fs30}scared of her own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时活在丈夫的阴影下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my shadow, it was my husband's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来什么都不怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't seem scared of nothing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变化真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a late bloomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你也能变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见莫尔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen Merle around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟你说对不起了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He say he was sorry yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确实对不起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会补偿你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会逼着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要一点点宽容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just needs to be a little forgiveness is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我绑在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tied me to a chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒打我  把一个行尸扔进屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat me, and threw a walker in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个也许我能释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I could call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把玛姬带到一个恐吓她的人面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took Maggie to a man who terrorized her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羞辱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}humiliated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在乎她比在乎我多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care more about her than I care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正要喊你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to holler back at ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这下面干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这里有没有冰毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just looking for a little crystal meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在风平浪静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit will mess my life up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸毒会毁了大好人生  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}when everything is going so sweet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟瑞克谈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk to Rick yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当然  我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, yeah. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心肠做不了这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ain't got the stomach for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会改变主意  你懂的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna buckle. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想怎样  随他去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does, he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.07,0:11:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望他改主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want him to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he says goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even possess
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有种啊  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pair of balls, little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胆子都被吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they even attached?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有主见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if they are, do they belong to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾称那样的人为随波逐流者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to call people like that sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢  对格伦和玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with you and Glenn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在世道不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我当恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people look at me like I'm the devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我绑架了那对情侣  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}grabbing up those lovebirds like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们将要做的事  跟我毫无差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now y'all want to do the same damn thing I did--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绑架某人然后交给总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}snatch someone up and deliver them to the Governor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了活命  人什么都能做出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People do what they got to do or they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不靠别人  就无法生存  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do things without people anymore, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们需要我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe these people need somebody like me around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮他们做下流勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do their dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唱白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe that's how it is now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对此怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想哥在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want my brother back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在这里烦我  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你不要惧怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thou shalt not be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.75,0:13:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑夜的惊骇\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the terror by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是白日飞的箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor for the arrow that flieth by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不必恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor for the pestilence 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑夜蔓延的瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}that walketh in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:14:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是午间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor for the destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灭人的毒病\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasteth at noonday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纵有千人仆倒在你旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}1,000 shall fall at thy side
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万人仆倒在你右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 10,000 at thy right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这灾却不得临近你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it shall not come nigh thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你惟有亲眼观看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only with thine eyes shalt thou behold
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见恶人遭报\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see the reward of the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他必救你脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely He shall deliver thee
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捕鸟人的网罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the snare of the fowler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与瘟疫的毒害"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from the noisome pestilence."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:14:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他必用自己的翎毛遮蔽你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He shall cover thee
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你要投靠在他的翅膀底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and under His wings shalt thou trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祸患必不临到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There shall no evil befall thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾害也绝不挨近你的帐棚"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither shall any plague come nigh thy dwelling."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你们俩的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wouldn't do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep you two safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做的那件事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're about to do--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪里  -拐角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where is it? - Around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先清理行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to clear some walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后让其他人过来修补\N{\fnArial\fs30}then get the others down here to barricade it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的漏洞等于给总督送上请柬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A breach like this could be an open invitation to the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可没那么精明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not much for subtlety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take your chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督跟瑞克定下协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor made Rick an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出你  然后和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn you over and we all give peace a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意  这个决定令他会良心不安  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with you, though. He would have blinked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你一向很坦诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being straight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是你骗我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were straight when you led me into the tombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也许我没那么坦诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe I wasn't straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还用袋子蒙住我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put a bag over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能下狠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是那种会回到屋顶救我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a guy that came back for me on that rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脏活还得靠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这才是我回到那里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure that's why I was back there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干其他人做不了的坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借刀一用\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不说话就是答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我以为你会逃跑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'd figured you would have run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走之前我得拿回我的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted my sword back before I get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may go down that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会抱太大的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't get my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行动取消  我们跟总督硬碰硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's off. We'll take our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前的决定不一定是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it was the wrong call,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这绝对是正确选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is definitely the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.51,0:19:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找不到莫尔和米琼恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find Merle or Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.19,0:19:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚才在这儿来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说要找些毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was looking for drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他还说了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said a lot of things, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你会改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said that you were gonna change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他是把她从这儿带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he took her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地上有痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They mixed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  我去追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! I'm going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不会追踪  -那我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't track for shit. - Then the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前就说过要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'd go and I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且万一他们来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus they're gonna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家人也要做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和我弟弟在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我弟弟想留在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, he wants to be in the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许可以保全监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it'll keep that place standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果计划成功  或许我能获得原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I pull it off, maybe all is forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多的或许了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a whole lot of maybes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有其他选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to play the hands you're dealt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不停说自己有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about the weight of what you have to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干脏活有多伟大\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但一个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bad man,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个邪恶的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone truly evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们轻如鸿毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变后  我已经杀了十六个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed 16 men since all this went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看那个混蛋都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what that bastard's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be others like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}There always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  就像行尸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's like the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都改变不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你给我这个表时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you gave me this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不完全明白你的用意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't fully understand what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a simple thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it means now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了其中的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要娶玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to marry Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不用办婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't have to have a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我们能不能活过这周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know if we'll last the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want her to know
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.07,0:22:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生命结束之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赞同  祝福你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前为止一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.13,0:24:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.33,0:24:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.12,0:24:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.74,0:24:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.42,0:25:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.87,0:26:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的特长就是干脏活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is this your thing, then? You take out the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么刻薄  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so hard on yourself, darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.61,0:26:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是总督  还是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.38,0:26:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有人的夜壶满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyone who needs their piss bucket emptied
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.05,0:26:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就抢着去倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you come a-running.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.69,0:26:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟就不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are different for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.59,0:26:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他唯瑞克马首是瞻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick says jump and he wants to know how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克离不开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-mmm. Rick needs him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬重他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respects him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克可没要求他干这活儿  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't ask him to do this little job, now, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  因为只有我能办妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 'cause he wants it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.90,0:26:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.41,0:26:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  这对你本是个大好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is this could have been your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭你的本事  一个全新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your skills, a whole new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你选择继续当个外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you choose to stay on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.22,0:26:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死了没人会惦记\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's gonna mourn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.69,0:27:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在有了个新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.30,0:27:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再试图惹怒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep trying to get under my skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.77,0:27:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就把你舌头割了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna cut that tongue out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克把你交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your buddy's turning you over
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了自保\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he's trying to save his own ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我一样  都是外人  姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as much on the outside as I am, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.98,0:27:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可等总督折磨死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once the Governor's done with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我不用苟活于世\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least I won't have to live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说灾变后你杀了十六个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you killed 16 men since this thing started?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.41,0:28:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变前你杀过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever kill anyone before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.71,0:28:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.25,0:28:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到伍德伯里之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how about before Woodbury?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你认识总督之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  他救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he saves your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.60,0:28:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你吃穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}cleans you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.53,0:28:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}fed you a line of bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.63,0:28:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要给他当杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you kill somebody else for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:55.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we can go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.41,0:28:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.91,0:29:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.85,0:29:02.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can just go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.05,0:29:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.02,0:29:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.73,0:29:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.23,0:29:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回去找他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go back with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.83,0:29:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready for what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点事要独自去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something I got to do on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.48,0:30:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哥在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.86,0:30:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把他杀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.35,0:31:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.22,0:31:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让他们找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let anyone come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿来的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.73,0:33:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to spread out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.70,0:33:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.11,0:33:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.49,0:34:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.85,0:34:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他留给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.89,0:35:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会求饶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.39,0:35:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会向你求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.13,0:35:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.31,0:35:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.15,0:35:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.95,0:35:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去  瑞克有事要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should head over. Rick has something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.99,0:36:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.11,0:36:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}one more thing before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.85,0:36:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.17,0:37:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去见总督时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I met with the Governor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.44,0:37:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他提出一项协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}he offered me a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.47,0:37:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.91,0:37:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我交出米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he would leave us alone
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.51,0:37:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就不再骚扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I give him Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.85,0:37:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保证大家的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was gonna do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.46,0:37:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.93,0:37:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我改变了主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.10,0:37:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在莫尔把米琼恩带去赴约\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now Merle took Michonne to fulfill the deal
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而达里尔前去阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Daryl went to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.41,0:37:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是否已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't know if it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.68,0:38:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该瞒着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong not to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.12,0:38:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.56,0:38:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年农场遇袭后的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I said last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}that first night
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.67,0:38:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过要独裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the farm...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.81,0:38:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.04,0:38:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做什么  我们的底限\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we do, what we're willing to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是谁  这些不是我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}who we are, it's not my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.85,0:38:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.78,0:38:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能为顾全大局牺牲我们当中任何一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't sacrifice one of us for the greater good
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.76,0:38:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们每个人都是大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we are the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.36,0:38:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才是我们还活着的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the reason we're still here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.63,0:38:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事关生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.37,0:38:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你如何活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you live...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.07,0:38:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you die--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.31,0:38:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}it isn't up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.17,0:38:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你们的总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.48,0:39:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起选择离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We choose to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.31,0:39:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起选择留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We choose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们团结一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.49,0:39:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}We vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.69,0:39:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以留下  可以战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stay and we can fight
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.73,0:39:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!